#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:105
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These conventions were more or less decided by `Pandoc <https://pandoc.org/"
">`_'s mediawiki to reStructuredText conversion. If you need more than 4 "
"headings, ask yourself first if the page hasn't gotten too complicated and "
"needs splitting up."
msgstr ""
"O teh konvencijah je bolj ali manj odločala mediawiki <https://pandoc.org/> "
"'Pandoc's mediawiki za pretvorbo prestrukturiranja vtext. Če potrebujete več "
"kot 4 naslove, se najprej vprašajte, ali se stran ni preveč zapletla in se "
"mora razdeliti."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:107
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sometimes you need to link to a subsection of a page, add a label above the "
"heading in that case."
msgstr ""
"Včasih morate povezati do pododdelka strani, dodati oznako nad naslovom v "
"tem primeru."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:109
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Headers should not end with punctuation, as the header will be used as the "
"link name when linking to a label."
msgstr ""
"Glave se ne smejo končati s ločili, saj bo glava uporabljena kot ime "
"povezave pri povezovanju z oznako."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:112
msgid "Linking"
msgstr "Povezovanje"

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:114
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Linking is done with ``:ref:`label_name```. When you need an alternative "
"link text, you use ``:ref:`actual text shown <label_name>```."
msgstr ""
"Povezovanje se opravi z '':ref:'label_name'''. Ko potrebujete nadomestno "
"besedilo povezave, uporabite »:ref:'dejansko besedilo, prikazano "
"<label_name>»«."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:116
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Linking to external pages is done with ```url`_`` and ```link name "
"<url>`_``, which'll become `link name <url>`_."
msgstr ""
"Povezovanje z zunanjimi stranmi se opravi z '''url'_'' in '''ime povezave "
"<url>'_'', ki bo postalo 'ime <url>povezave '_.</url></url>"

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:118
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`Pandoc <https://pandoc.org/>`_ likes to turn these into ```link name`__`` "
"and then add ``.. __ :url`` at the end of the document. This is a so-called "
"'anonymous hyperlink', meaning that depending on the order of the links "
"appearing in the text the order of the links at the end of the text are "
"associated with one another. If this sounds confusing and difficult, it is "
"because it is. That is also the exact reason why we'd like to avoid links "
"like these."
msgstr ""
"'Pandoc <https://pandoc.org/>'_ rad spremeni te v '''ime povezave'__'' in "
"nato doda ''.. __ :url'' na koncu dokumenta. To je tako imenovana \"anonimna "
"hiperpovezava\", kar pomeni, da je glede na vrstni red povezav, ki se "
"pojavljajo v besedilu, vrstni red povezav na koncu besedila povezan med "
"seboj. Če to zveni zmedeno in težko, je to zato, ker je. To je tudi razlog, "
"zakaj bi se radi izognili takim povezavam."

