#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:349
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Full grid tables are best for when you need all features like complex column "
"and row spans, but they're tricky to make. For that reason, small tables are "
"best off being done with the simple syntax, while really long tables are "
"best done with a list directive because that is just much easier to write "
"and maintain."
msgstr ""
"Polne mrežne tabele so najboljše za to, ko potrebujete vse funkcije, kot so "
"kompleksna polja stolpcev in vrstic, vendar jih je zapleteno narediti. Zato "
"je najbolje, da se majhne tabele opravijo s preprosto sintakso, medtem ko so "
"res dolge tabele najbolje narejene z direktivo o seznamu, ker je to "
"preprosto veliko lažje pisati in vzdrževati."

