#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:414
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Horizontal rulers are usually used when the topic switches rather directly. "
"This is very common in more narrative based writing, such as history or "
"fiction. The Krita manual is more instruction and reference style writing, "
"that is to say, we don't usually tell a long story to indicate how different "
"elements come together, but rather long stories are there to motivate why "
"certain steps are taken in a certain manner. Topic changes then usually "
"happen because we go into a new section, rather than switching to a related "
"section. It is therefore better to use headings or the ``.. Topic::`` "
"directive. Headings also make it easier to read."
msgstr ""
"Vodoravna pravila se običajno uporabljajo, ko se tema preklopi precej "
"neposredno. To je zelo pogosto v bolj pripovednem pisanju, kot je zgodovina "
"ali fikcija. Priročnik Krita je več pouka in referenčnega sloga pisanja, se "
"pravi, da ponavadi ne povemo dolge zgodbe, da bi kazali, kako se različni "
"elementi združijo, ampak so tam dolge zgodbe, da bi motivirale, zakaj so "
"določeni koraki sprejeti na določen način. Spremembe teme se potem običajno "
"zgodijo, ker gremo v nov odsek, namesto da bi preklopli na sorodni odsek. "
"Zato je bolje uporabiti naslove ali \".. Tema::'' direktiva. Tudi naslovi "
"olajšajo branje."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:418
#, fuzzy
msgid "That said, horizontal rulers can be made with ``----``."
msgstr "To je dejal, horizontalni vladarji se lahko z \"----\"."

